MCP - Model context protocol - standardises protocal for LLMS
standardized way to ask with other sytems like databse, file, excel files with defined standards
Use specific MCP servers for playwright, selenium, etc as per defined standards and integrate it with VS code
Relavant information or methods configured to use like navigate to url, connrect to database, enter text, click 


AI Agent =  LLM + MCP Servers

LLMS - Claude, Gemini, chatgpt, etc

Claude - MCP server configuration file(Json)

|                    |
Playwright MCP      MySQl MCP ------ Excel MCP, Rest API MCP, File System MCP, Github, Jira, Slack MCps etc

|                    |
Web Browsers       Database ---------- Excel files, external Apis, file system, etc

LLM will remember previous action change done based on some condition for next test case while generating test case or code i.e LLM learns from historic data

Export postman collection and use file system read mcp to read the data in collection file for api testing both api and file mcps can be used together
Excel also used along with file system to know the location of file


MCP with VS Code:
used to perform below actions with prompt only:
Build playwright framework
add tests
coomit and push the code to github(add github mcp server configuration in json file and for this docker desktop should be present in system)

Prepare custom sub agents for specific tasks using configure models option under github copilot and give instruction what this agent needs to perform
Multi Agents - having multiple permissions - helps in scalability, parallel execution, easier maintainance and specialization


