Agentic AI Solutions:
Takes action and makes decision based on goals instead of just reponding to prompts
Multiple agents communicate each other to solve the problem proactively
Example : integrating jira agent and playwright agent. Jiras latest bugs converted into test cases and automation scripts created and executed and update the status back in jira

AutoGen and Crew AI are examples for agentic ai solutions
